    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "It's just hoops... Or is it?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547940/extras/daf4258e67da35c1d600bcbf53e58395.avif?t=1706056181\" /></span><br><br>Relax and shoot some hoops in a variety of scenic locations. Choose from basic courts, or courts with challenging trick shots &amp; long shots! <br><br>Immerse yourself in the world of first-person basketball, where players can test their shooting abilities on a range of courts. <br><br>Drawing inspiration from iconic shooter titles that included hidden (and often overlooked) basketball mini-games and physics-based novelty features, Hoops World allows you to discover the joy of sinking hoops and trick-shots in unique locations such as indoor courts, stadiums, beaches, and more!<br><br>Transforming a classic, quirky gaming element into a full-fledged FPS basketball experience, Hoops World is a great way to relax in your own world!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547940/extras/599f93f8a667499340315db0d496f192.avif?t=1706056181\" /></span><br><br>Along with various basketball courts and locations, Hoops World includes physics-based fun!<br><br>Drive vehicles around various racetracks, drifting and sliding around a variety of scenic locations in between sinking hoops and exploring! <br><br>Find many different physics-based objects to play around with. <strong>Hoops World</strong> is <strong>your world</strong> - play any way you like!",
    "about_the_game": "It's just hoops... Or is it?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547940/extras/daf4258e67da35c1d600bcbf53e58395.avif?t=1706056181\" /></span><br><br>Relax and shoot some hoops in a variety of scenic locations. Choose from basic courts, or courts with challenging trick shots &amp; long shots! <br><br>Immerse yourself in the world of first-person basketball, where players can test their shooting abilities on a range of courts. <br><br>Drawing inspiration from iconic shooter titles that included hidden (and often overlooked) basketball mini-games and physics-based novelty features, Hoops World allows you to discover the joy of sinking hoops and trick-shots in unique locations such as indoor courts, stadiums, beaches, and more!<br><br>Transforming a classic, quirky gaming element into a full-fledged FPS basketball experience, Hoops World is a great way to relax in your own world!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547940/extras/599f93f8a667499340315db0d496f192.avif?t=1706056181\" /></span><br><br>Along with various basketball courts and locations, Hoops World includes physics-based fun!<br><br>Drive vehicles around various racetracks, drifting and sliding around a variety of scenic locations in between sinking hoops and exploring! <br><br>Find many different physics-based objects to play around with. <strong>Hoops World</strong> is <strong>your world</strong> - play any way you like!",
    "short_description": "The perfect first-person playground. Shoot hoops, drift a go-kart, explore the world and beyond!",
